WEBVTT

00:22:58.417 --> 00:23:01.559
No one is exempt from this,

00:23:01.583 --> 00:23:05.875
especially in my white community.

00:23:06.958 --> 00:23:09.726
We must do that work in our hearts,

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.375
the antiracism work.

00:23:12.792 --> 00:23:14.101
The second thing is

00:23:14.125 --> 00:23:16.643
that I encourage people

00:23:16.667 --> 00:23:19.976
to look at the nonviolence training
that we [have] at the King Center,

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.143
thekingcenter.org,

00:23:22.167 --> 00:23:25.351
so that we learn the foundation
of understanding

00:23:25.375 --> 00:23:28.500
our interrelatedness
and interconnectedness.

00:23:29.833 --> 00:23:33.184
That we understand our loyalties
and our commitments